<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(c) </span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>
(a) Samples from a diffusion model trained directly on <math id="A8.F10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="64\times 64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">64\times 64</annotation></semantics></math> FFHQ.
(b, c) Samples from latent diffusion models trained on (b) GPE and (c) VAE representations.
Generated latents are mapped back to image space using their respective decoders. The diffusion models use the U-Net architecture within the EDM framework.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A8.T3" class="ltx_table">
