For the pixel model, images are generated by sampling a diffusion model trained directly on FFHQ.
For the GPE and VAE models, images are generated by sampling diffusion models trained in the latent space and decoding the generated latents using the corresponding decoder. The diffusion models use the U-Net architecture within the EDM framework.
</figcaption>
